    "detailed_description": "<h1>No Updates</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, I have lost the source code for this project. For that reason, there will be no future updates or content added. It won't be possible to fix any bugs too.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>INVERT: The Climb</strong> is a rage inducing precision platformer with no checkpoints.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Your Goal?</strong> To reach the moon! It's as easy as it sounds... ok maybe not.<br></li><li> <strong>How To Play?</strong> You can invert the map to show new paths or... fall down to the start. Your choice I guess...</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>High Stakes Platforming:</strong> The only way to the moon is up, if you fall then that's on you.<br></li><li> <strong>Inverting:</strong> Invert the map to show new platforms but destroy old ones.<br></li><li> <strong>Experience All Emotions:</strong> The emotions you'll probably experience are happiness, satisfaction, peace, pride, heartbreak, anxiety, stress, confusion, frustration, that one emotion you experience when you throw your controller, a sense of being cheated, pain, and most importantly, rage.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> All your progress is saved, both good and bad.<br></li><li> An addictive gameplay loop.<br></li><li> Online leaderboards based on fastest time.</li></ul>",
